好，这次我逐块教你写，每一块都讲"为什么"。你照着敲进 `app/velaguard/velaguard_rs485.c`，敲完我们接线编译。

**第 1 块：头文件和常量**

```c
#include <nuttx/config.h>

#include <sys/types.h>
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <string.h>
#include <fcntl.h>
#include <unistd.h>
#include <errno.h>

#define DEFAULT_DEV "/dev/rs485"
#define PAYLOAD     "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"   /* 恰好 26 字节 */
#define PAYLOAD_LEN 26
```

为什么：
- `fcntl.h` 给 `open`、`unistd.h` 给 `read/write/close`、`string.h` 给 `memcmp/strcmp`、`errno.h` 给错误码；
- 把设备路径和测试负载做成宏，是"不要魔法数字"的规范——以后改设备/换负载只动这两行。

**第 2 块：发送 `do_tx`**

```c
static int do_tx(FAR const char *dev)
{
  char buf[PAYLOAD_LEN];
  ssize_t n;
  int fd;
  int total = 0;

  memcpy(buf, PAYLOAD, PAYLOAD_LEN);

  fd = open(dev, O_RDWR);
  if (fd < 0)
    {
      fprintf(stderr, "vgrs485: open %s failed: %d\n", dev, errno);
      return 1;
    }

  while (total < PAYLOAD_LEN)
    {
      n = write(fd, buf + total, PAYLOAD_LEN - total);
      if (n < 0)
        {
          fprintf(stderr, "vgrs485: write failed: %d\n", errno);
          close(fd);
          return 1;
        }

      total += n;
    }

  printf("vgrs485: sent %d bytes: %s\n", total, buf);
  close(fd);
  return 0;
}
```

为什么这个循环：`write()` 的返回值是"**这次实际写进去多少字节**"，可能小于你请求的长度（尤其以后 DMA/缓冲模式下常见）。`buf + total` 是"从还没写完的位置继续"，`PAYLOAD_LEN - total` 是"还剩多少"。这个 **write 循环模板**以后写任何串口/网络发送都通用。

**第 3 块：接收 + 校验 `do_rx`（重点）**

```c
static int do_rx(FAR const char *dev)
{
  char buf[PAYLOAD_LEN];
  ssize_t n;
  int fd;
  int total = 0;

  fd = open(dev, O_RDWR);
  if (fd < 0)
    {
      fprintf(stderr, "vgrs485: open %s failed: %d\n", dev, errno);
      return 1;
    }

  printf("vgrs485: waiting for %d bytes on %s...\n", PAYLOAD_LEN, dev);
  while (total < PAYLOAD_LEN)
    {
      n = read(fd, buf + total, PAYLOAD_LEN - total);
      if (n < 0)
        {
          fprintf(stderr, "vgrs485: read failed: %d\n", errno);
          close(fd);
          return 1;
        }

      total += n;   /* n==0 时 total 不变，继续等 */
    }

  if (memcmp(buf, PAYLOAD, PAYLOAD_LEN) == 0)
    {
      printf("vgrs485: PASS - payload matched\n");
      close(fd);
      return 0;
    }

  printf("vgrs485: FAIL - mismatch, received:\n");
  for (int i = 0; i < PAYLOAD_LEN; i++)
    {
      printf("%02x ", (unsigned char)buf[i]);
    }

  printf("\n");
  close(fd);
